    <string name="about_title">About PKG Tool</string>
    <string name="about_body">This app reads unencrypted PKGs, extracts the PFS contents and creates unsigned PKGs from a folder.\n\n• Retail encrypted PKGs are not supported: no proprietary keys are included.\n• Created PKGs are homebrew-style and are not signed by Sony.\n• This version accepts PKGs up to 4 GiB.\n• File access uses the Storage Access Framework (SAF); no broad storage permission is requested.\n\nBuilt with Rust, Jetpack Compose and Material 3 Expressive.</string>
